# ===========================================================================
#  HAX EDITOR - KEYBINDING CONFIG EXAMPLE
# ===========================================================================
# Copy this file to ~/.config/hax/config and edit it.
# Format:  key = action
#
# Key names (case and separators don't matter):
#   ctrl-q, Ctrl+Q, ctrlq, Ctrl q    → all mean Ctrl+Q
#   pageup, PageUp, page_up, Page Up → all mean Page Up
#
# Full list of actions on the next page.
# ===========================================================================

# === NORMAL MODE actions ===
#   quit              save              open
#   search            command_palette   new_file
#   toggle_sidebar    yank              cut
#   paste             cursor_left       cursor_right
#   cursor_up         cursor_down       cursor_home
#   cursor_end        page_up           page_down
#   new_line          insert_tab        delete_forward
#   delete_backward   escape

# === FILE EXPLORER actions ===
#   up      down    open    rename
#   parent  back

# === SEARCH actions ===
#   up    down    open    back

# === COMMAND PALETTE actions ===
#   up      down    execute    back

# --- Vim-style example ---
# ctrl-h = cursor_left
# ctrl-j = cursor_down
# ctrl-k = cursor_up
# ctrl-l = cursor_right
